
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`LIST_STAT_NUM_COUNT: number = 8`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer LIST_STAT_NUM_COUNT = 8;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant LIST_STAT_NUM_COUNT has the value 8</p>
  <p>Retrieves the number of float and integer elements.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>ListStatisticsOperation</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Related Articles</h2>
  <h3>Functions</h3>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>•</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlListStatistics" target="_blank">llListStatistics</a></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local mixedList = {5, 35.3, vector(1, 2, 3), "42", "Hello"}
local num = ll.ListStatistics(LIST_STAT_NUM_COUNT, mixedList)
--num == 2.0`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`list mixedList = [5, 35.3, <1,2,3>, "42", "Hello"];
float num = llListStatistics( LIST_STAT_NUM_COUNT, mixedList );
//num == 2.0`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <p><a href="https://secondlife.canny.io/?search=LIST_STAT_NUM_COUNT" target="_blank">Search Canny for related Issues</a></p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>Signature</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`
LIST_STAT_NUM_COUNT = 8
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`
integer LIST_STAT_NUM_COUNT = 8;
`} lang="lsl" /></div>

</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

</DocsLayout>
      